{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmlg76uytt40","created":1793696095961,"text":"GPS 卫星信号的产生、\n调制、传播与接收机解调原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgm0hfmsg0","created":1793697257545,"text":"标称基准频率"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgmdbkigo0","created":1793697285488,"text":"10.23 MHz"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgo3m561s0","created":1793697421088,"text":"调制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgo66r0oo0","created":1793697426688,"text":"幅度调制 AM"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgo955ylc0","created":1793697433122,"text":"频率调制 FM"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgob529sw0","created":1793697437470,"text":"相位调制 PM"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgp0mn1v40","created":1793697492952,"text":"BPSK（Binary Phase Shift Keying，二进制相移键控）","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgrndf1b40","created":1793697699189,"text":"假设要发送两个数字：0 和 1。\nBPSK 可以用两个相差 180° 的载波相位状态来表示它们。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgrvfcecg0","created":1793697716719,"text":"将正弦载波乘以 −1，相当于将它的相位翻转 180°"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgs0ia0480","created":1793697727781,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}